{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c0aca52f-aa62-80d6-a17a-78ed0d75db2f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:31:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Helena M. Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:30:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Beth. I want to report a broken swing at one of the playgrounds. I should tell you I'm sitting in a drive-through line, so if I cut out, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, go ahead. Which playground is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one down at the beach park, the little one by the parking lot. The seat on the far swing is cracked right through and one chain is hanging loose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the far swing, cracked seat, loose chain. Is it a baby swing or a regular one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Regular one. The kind with the flat seat. A kid could get hurt on it, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:31:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll send that to the parks crew today and they'll get it taken out of use."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Oh, I'm moving up, hold on. [pause] Okay. Is there a web page where I can see the same information, like about the beach parks and who to report things to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the city website has a recreation section with the parks and beaches listed. You can find the contact info there too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, I'll look it up when I get home. Thanks, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:31:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you for calling it in. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
